[{"title":"无题和唐李义山商隐 其一","author":"杨基","text":"一瓣芙蕖是彩舟，棹歌离思两夷犹。\n风鬟雾鬓遥相忆，月户云窗许暂留。\n波冷绿尘罗袜晓，恨添红叶翠颦秋。\n双鸾镜里瑶台雪，任是无情也上头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":574,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春草","author":"杨基","text":"嫩绿柔香远更浓，春来无处不茸茸。\n六朝旧恨斜阳里，南浦新愁细雨中。\n近水欲迷歌扇绿，隔花偏衬舞裙红。\n平川十里人归晚，无数牛羊一笛风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":575,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清平乐","author":"杨基","text":"欺烟困雨，拂拂愁千缕。\n曾把腰肢羞舞女，赢得轻盈如许。\n犹寒未暖时光，将昏渐晓池塘。\n记取春来杨柳，风流全在轻黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":576,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮","author":"杨基","text":"水晶帘外娟娟月，梨花枝上层层雪。\n花月两模糊，隔窗看欲无。\n月华今夜黑，全见梨花白。\n花也笑姮娥，让他春色多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":577,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滇海曲 其十二","author":"杨慎","text":"海滨龙市趁春畬，江曲鱼村弄晚霞。\n孔雀行穿鹦鹉树，锦莺飞啄杜鹃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":578,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滇海曲 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"梁王阁榭水中央，乌鹊双星带五潢。\n跨海虹桥三十里，广寒宫殿夜飘香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":579,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登南海驿楼","author":"汪广洋","text":"海气空濛日夜浮，山城才雨便成秋。\n冯唐头白偏多感，倚遍天南百尺楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":580,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庐山高","author":"沈周","text":"庐山高，高乎哉！\n郁然二百五十里之盘距。\n岌乎二千三百丈之，谓即敷浅原。\n培何敢争其雄？\n西来天堑濯其足，云霞旦夕吞吐乎其胸。\n回崖沓嶂鬼手擘，涧道千丈开鸿。\n瀑流淙淙泻不极，雷霆殷地闻者耳欲聋。\n时有落叶于其间，直下彭蠡流霜虹。\n金膏水碧不可觅，石林幽黑号绿熊。\n其阳诸峰五老人，或疑纬星之精隳自空。\n陈夫子，今仲弓，世家庐之下，有元劂祖迁江东。\n尚知庐灵有默契，不远千里钏于公。\n公亦西望怀故都，便欲往依五老巢云松。\n昔闻紫阳祀六老，不妨添公相与成七翁。\n我常游公门，仰公弥高庐。\n不崇丘园肥遁七十淫，著作白发如秋蓬。\n文能合坟诗合雅。\n自得乐地于其中。\n荣名利禄云过眼，上不作书自荐，下不公相通。\n公乎！\n浩荡在物表，黄鹄高举凌天风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":581,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯歌","author":"沈明臣","text":"衔枚夜度五千兵，密领军符号令明。\n狭巷短兵相接处，杀人如草不闻声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":582,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南泉庵","author":"邱道隆","text":"南征战士欲投戈，寻乐施旗映薜萝。\n酒熟田家来赛社，晚晴渔舍乱堆蓑。\n半帘风月吟中趣，一剑功名水上波。\n指点当年陈迹在，几人襟袖泪痕多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":583,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡易水","author":"陈子龙","text":"并刀昨夜匣中鸣，燕赵悲歌最不平。\n易水潺湲云草碧，可怜无处送荆卿！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":584,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辽事杂诗","author":"陈子龙","text":"卢龙雄塞倚天开，十载三逢敌骑来。\n碛里角声摇日月，回中烽色动楼台。\n陵园白露年年满，城郭青磷夜夜哀。\n共道安危任樽俎，即今谁是出群才！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":585,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日杂感","author":"陈子龙","text":"行吟坐啸独悲秋，海雾江云引暮愁。\n不信有天常似醉，最怜无地可埋忧。\n荒荒葵井多新鬼，寂寂瓜田识故侯。\n见说五湖供饮马，沧浪何处着渔舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":586,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遇桐城方密之于湖上，归复相访，赠之以诗","author":"陈子龙","text":"仙才寂寞两悠悠，文苑荒凉尽古丘。\n汉体昔年称北地，楚风今日满南州。\n可成雅乐张瑶海？\n且剩微辞戏玉楼。\n颇厌人间枯槁句，裁云剪月画三秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":587,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三洲歌","author":"陈子龙","text":"相送巴陵口，含泪上舟行。\n不知三江水，何事亦分流？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":588,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山花子","author":"陈子龙","text":"杨柳凄迷晓雾中，杏花零落五更钟。\n寂寂景阳宫外月，照残红。\n蝶化彩衣金缕尽，虫衔画粉玉楼空。\n惟有无情双燕子，舞东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":589,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诉衷情令","author":"陈子龙","text":"小桃枝下试罗裳，蝶粉斗遗香。\n玉轮碾平芳草，半面恼红妆。\n风乍暖，日初长，袅垂杨。\n一双舞燕，万点飞花，满地斜阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":590,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"念奴娇 春雪咏兰","author":"陈子龙","text":"问天何意，到春深、千里龙山飞雪？\n解佩凌波人不见，漫说芷珠宫阙。\n楚殿烟微，湘潭月冷，料得都攀折。\n嫣然幽谷，只愁又听啼鴃。\n当日九畹光风，数茎清露，纤手分花叶。\n曾在多情怀袖里，一缕同心千结。\n玉腕香销，云鬟雾掩，空赠金跳脱。\n洛滨江上，寻芳再望佳节。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":591,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画堂春 雨中杏花","author":"陈子龙","text":"轻阴池馆水平桥，一番弄雨花梢。\n微寒著处不胜娇，此际魂销。\n忆昔青门堤外，粉香零乱朝朝。\n玉颜寂寞淡红飘，无那今宵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":592,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"点绛唇 春日风雨有感","author":"陈子龙","text":"满眼韶华，东风惯是吹红去。\n几番烟雾，只有花难护。\n梦里相思，故国王孙路，春无主！\n杜鹃啼处，泪染胭脂雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":593,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒金门 五月雨","author":"陈子龙","text":"莺啼处，摇荡一天疏雨。\n极目平芜人尽去，断红明碧树。\n费得炉烟无数，只有轻寒难度。\n忽见西楼花影露，弄晴催薄暮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":594,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊","author":"陈昂","text":"此地知何处，扁舟系小亭。\n孤村低卧水，野屋大于瓶。\n却少犁锄乐，尚余锋镝腥。\n白头万里客，仰愧老人星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":595,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"陈嘉谋","text":"施氏山前旧有人，吴王宫殿几重新。\n年来绿树村边月，夜半清溪梦里身。\n衰草尽随眉黛落，飞花长逐杜鹃声。\n西家女侠今何在？\n白苎轻萝谢四邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":596,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺怨","author":"周在","text":"江南二月试罗衣，春尽燕山雪尚飞。\n应是子规啼不到，故乡虽好不思归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":597,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月牙岩","author":"周进隆","text":"翠微峭拔倚天表，半轮月照桂江小。\n岩头黄乌栖高枝，一声啼破千山小。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":598,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄丘生东粤","author":"呼文如","text":"郎马无凭似蟢蛛，也有游丝在路途。\n侬心好似春蚕茧，镇日牵丝不出庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":599,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答情人","author":"季贞一","text":"寄买红绫束，何须问短长。\n妾身君抱里，尺寸自思量。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":600,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺女焚香","author":"林鸿","text":"桂殿焚香酒半醒，露华如水扑银屏。\n含情欲诉心中事，羞见牵牛织女星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":601,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诫子弟","author":"林翰","text":"何事纷争一角墙，让他几尺又何妨。\n长城万里今犹在，不见当年秦始皇！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":602,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游黄山题汤院壁","author":"罗洪先","text":"何年白日骑鸾鹤，踏碎天都峰上云。\n欲起轩辕问九鼎，道衣重侍玉虚君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":603,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拜靖节墓","author":"罗洪先","text":"久憎折腰事，再拜向高坟。\n东晋非前日，南山还暮云。\n将持斗酒酹，更以挽歌闻。\n不饮缘何事，低回心已醺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":604,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游黄山题汤院壁","author":"罗洪先","text":"紫翠林中便赤足，白龙潭上看青山。\n药炉丹井知何处，三十六峰烟月寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":605,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与尹推府","author":"俞大猷","text":"匣内青锋磨砺久，连舟航海斩妖魑。\n笑看风浪迷天地，静拨盘针定夏夷。\n渊隐虬龙惊阵跃，汉飞牛斗避锋移。\n捷书驰报承明主，沧海而今波不澌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":606,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽诗","author":"祝枝山","text":"少日同怀天下奇，中年出世也曾期；朱丝竹绝桐薪韵，黄土生埋玉树枝。\n生老病余吾尚在，去来今际子先知；当时欲印槌机事，可解中宵入梦思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":607,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行俳体十二首 其一","author":"钟惺","text":"村烟城树远依依，解指青溪与翠微。\n风送白鱼争入市，江过黄鹄渐多矶。\n家从久念方惊别，地喜初来也似归。\n近日江南新涝后，稻虾难比往年肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":608,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日舟中题胡彭举秋江卷","author":"钟惺","text":"望远写秋江，秋意无起止。\n何曾见寸波，竟纸皆秋水。\n烟中过寒山，江净翻如纸。\n空色有无间，身在秋江里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":609,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"《拍案惊奇·卷卅六》","author":"凌濛初","text":"本待将心托明月，谁知明月照沟渠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":610,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"百步云梯","author":"唐世靖","text":"一线天高不可升，穿云深处有梯登。\n猿惊难上回山木，鸟骇迟飞落野藤。\n行客携筇常起伏，山僧着屐每凌兢。\n后阶先幸奇松护，独立能遮最上层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":611,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岳将军墓二首 其一","author":"唐顺之","text":"国耻犹未雪，身危亦自甘。\n九原人不返，万壑气长寒。\n岂恨藏弓早，终知借剑难。\n吾生非壮士，于此发冲冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":612,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人物山水画","author":"唐寅","text":"傍水依山结草庐，案头长贮活人书。\n不知施药功多少，仙杏花开锦不如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":613,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"女人","author":"唐寅","text":"这个女人不是人，九天仙女下凡尘。\n养个儿子会做贼，偷得蟠桃供母亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","p